Changes made relative to upstream
---------------------------------

Per GPLv3 section 5(a), this notice records that the following significant
changes were made when creating SparkyBin Browser from GNOME Web (Epiphany):

  * Renamed the application and all user-visible branding from
    "GNOME Web" / "Epiphany" to "SparkyBin Browser".
  * Changed the application ID from `org.gnome.Epiphany` to
    `com.sparkybin.Browser`, including all derived D-Bus names, GSettings
    schema IDs and paths, GResource prefixes, and object paths.
  * Changed the executable name from `epiphany` to `sparkybin-browser`.
  * Replaced the application icon artwork with new placeholder artwork.
  * Updated the AppStream metadata, desktop entry, D-Bus service files,
    GSettings schema, Doxygen/DOAP metadata, manual page, help pages, and
    build system to use the new name and identifiers.
  * Changed developer/organization metadata, homepage, and bug tracker URLs.

