Placeholders to review before release
-------------------------------------

The following values were set to placeholders during the rebrand and should be
reviewed and replaced with the project's real details:

  * Homepage, bug tracker, and download URLs
    (`https://github.com/sparkybin/sparkybin-browser`).
  * Contact email (`sparkybin@example.com`).
  * Application icon artwork in `data/icons/` and `help/C/media/`.
  * Flatpak `git` source URLs in `com.sparkybin.Browser.json` and
    `com.sparkybin.Browser.Canary.json`.
  * Help page screenshots (`help/C/media/epiphany-*.png`) still depict the
    upstream user interface.
  * The AppStream screenshot (`data/screenshot.png`) still depicts the upstream
    user interface.
